{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"I’ll build the per-fixture construction and refusal path first, using fresh admission coordinates and the independent checks from r6. I’ll also verify what the file-backed store must retain before proposing a location for a corpus record."}}
